{"body":{"model":"sonnet","reads":{"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000000"},"seedFrom":"inside","top":{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AS"},"understandings":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BG"}]},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AR","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000J"],"name":"branch-12"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much of each part's own governing survives being made part of a whole","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BC"}],"prose":"The paper is one long attempt to let many self-governing parts, each also a part of something larger, work as a whole without a single ruler. It names the kinds of care a part must carry, the way unlike parts are bound, and the places where this is tried out.","title":"Parts that keep their say, joined without a centre"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AS","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the balance between local autonomy and the bounds set from above","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"}],"prose":"A holon is at once whole and part, stacked in levels, with authority spread rather than gathered; the idea moved from a philosophical image through factory floors to grids, projects and data pipelines.","title":"The nested whole and where it came from"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AT","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"where a part's authority comes from: position versus self","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000116"}],"prose":"The holon is drawn by contrast with the agent and the flat multi-agent crowd: same autonomy, but position in a hierarchy bounds what each may decide, and humans or orchestrators can sit in the nesting.","title":"The nested form defined against agents"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AV","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how far the form carries beyond its home domain","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"}],"prose":"From manufacturing's early self-organising resources through energy grids, cyber-physical designs and construction scheduling, the form travels to wherever coordination is wanted without a centre.","title":"A lineage of use"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AW","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which shortfall is being named and what answers it","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000002"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"}],"prose":"Current autonomous systems are brittle when conditions shift, carry unseen bias, lack accountable reasoning and share too little awareness; the nested form, joined to learning twins, is offered as the remedy.","title":"Why the gap is felt"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AX","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the kind of harm a shortfall causes","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"}],"prose":"Brittleness in changing settings, bias from data and design, thin ethical reasoning, and poor shared context, each tied to sensitive domains.","title":"Four shortfalls"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AY","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"whether capability can grow without gathering control","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"}],"prose":"Real-time twins, federated learning and predictive control give parts the data and flexibility to adapt and recover without central oversight, while ethics must be built in once authority is spread.","title":"The promise of pairing with learning twins"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AZ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how much of the simulation's course the parts themselves decide","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B3"}],"prose":"The paper carries the family of agent-directed simulation over to holons: parts do not only populate a simulation but can shape how it runs, in degrees from passive to proactive.","title":"Simulation steered by its own parts"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B0","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which relation holds between actor and simulation","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"}],"prose":"Simulating agents, agents supporting a run, agents watching a run; simple local rules yielding large patterns; holons added as nested agents, and a new term coined for the step.","title":"Inherited kinds of simulation"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B1","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the degree of initiative a part takes over the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"}],"prose":"Holons may only report, react, learn, or rewrite the rules and objectives across federations.","title":"A ladder of initiative"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B2","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"cost and standardisation against the hoped-for adaptiveness","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003KQ"}],"prose":"Real-time role adaptation, coordination towards global optima, and the open costs: computation, standards and the tie to twins and learning.","title":"What building it asks"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B3","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which care a part carries and how it supports the others","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B7"}],"prose":"Each added dimension answers one shortfall by giving some holons a particular care: moral limits, long-run worth, comprehension, fairness, shared watchfulness. They are held to lean on one another and are conceptual roles, not fixed designs.","title":"Five faculties of a part"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B4","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the standard a decision is held to beyond speed","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004BS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"}],"prose":"Ethical holons bind decisions by rules and ontologies of principle against efficiency; effective holons weigh long-term and wider consequence against bare efficiency. Both struggle to define and measure their standard.","title":"Care for what is owed and what lasts"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B5","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the quality of knowledge a decision rests on","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"}],"prose":"Understanding holons turn scattered data into situated knowledge through ontologies and reasoning; unbiased holons name and counter known patterns of skew with audits and fairness limits. Both depend on building rich ontologies.","title":"Care for what is known and what is skewed"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B6","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"alignment between local information and global state","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100057F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"}],"prose":"Vigilant holons keep local knowledge aligned with the whole; the faculties then check, inform and watch one another across levels, summarised in a table.","title":"Care for the shared picture, and how all five interlock"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B7","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how much common ground is imposed versus negotiated","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BB"}],"prose":"Parts built by different hands, with different vocabularies, must still meet; the answer is a negotiated, runtime form of interoperability, embodied in a particular connecting holon.","title":"Binding unlike parts with no ruler"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B8","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what must be common before parts can speak","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"}],"prose":"Incompatibilities are conceptual, organizational and technological, touching data, service, process and business; solutions are one format for all, a shared layer, or transformation between parties with nothing shared.","title":"Kinds of mismatch and three ways of joining"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B9","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifetime of the shared meaning","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006F3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006GM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006JR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006N7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006P5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006PX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006T6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"}],"prose":"Joining at runtime, with temporary ontologies used for one exchange and then dropped, lets a newcomer be understood and the whole reconfigure without restart; prior work is cited for support and for domain illustrations.","title":"Meaning made on the spot"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BA","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
