{"body":{"matters":"whether the abstract roles can be given concrete parts that cohere","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BG"}],"prose":"The whole is tried on sparse-area transport: roles mapped onto riders, services and road monitors under the connecting holon, then a standard distributed simulation whose federates mirror and test the live holons, finding places without service.","title":"A trial ground in rural travel"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BC","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
