{"body":{"matters":"fidelity between the test copy and the live system","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"Holons are copied as federates over a runtime infrastructure; discrepancies are flagged upward, runs end with measured outcomes that feed back.","title":"Simulation as mirror and test"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BF","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
